### Registrar una solicitud (201 nueva, 200 si es reintento con mismos datos, 409 si cambia la informacion)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/loan-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestReference": "CANAL-APP-0001",
  "customerId": "CLI-0001",
  "requestedAmount": 10000000,
  "termMonths": 36,
  "monthlyIncome": 4000000,
  "creditScore": 720
}

### Misma referencia con informacion diferente -> 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/loan-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestReference": "CANAL-APP-0001",
  "customerId": "CLI-0001",
  "requestedAmount": 9000000,
  "termMonths": 36,
  "monthlyIncome": 4000000,
  "creditScore": 720
}

### Supera el limite diario del cliente -> REJECTED / DAILY_LIMIT_EXCEEDED
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/loan-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestReference": "CANAL-WEB-0002",
  "customerId": "CLI-0001",
  "requestedAmount": 6000000,
  "termMonths": 24,
  "monthlyIncome": 4000000,
  "creditScore": 720
}

### Entrada invalida -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/loan-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestReference": "CANAL-APP-0003",
  "customerId": "CLI-0002",
  "requestedAmount": 0,
  "termMonths": 3,
  "monthlyIncome": 1000000,
  "creditScore": 1200
}

### Consultar por requestReference
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/loan-requests?requestReference=CANAL-APP-0001

### Consultar por id (reemplazar por el id devuelto)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/loan-requests/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
